## Recommended Internal Structure

The system should be divided into two main Python components:

WIDS System
│
├── Monitoring and Detection Service
│   ├── Packet capture
│   ├── Packet parsing
│   ├── Feature extraction
│   ├── Detection rules
│   ├── Alert generation
│   └── Alert correlation
│
├── Flask Backend
│   ├── REST API
│   ├── Authentication
│   ├── Database access
│   ├── Rule configuration
│   ├── Monitoring control
│   ├── Statistics
│   └── System health
│
├── SQLite Database
│
└── React Dashboard
